markdown <<MARKDOWN
# How Unit 4 Builds on Unit 3

Unit 3 and Unit 4 may feel similar because both units involve data, collections, and interactive app features. The key difference is the **programming focus**.
 
In **Unit 3**, students focus on how data is structured and managed. They use arrays, objects, and built-in array methods like `map`, `push`, `pop`, `shift`, and `unshift` to represent and update information.

In **Unit 4**, students focus on how programs repeat logic across a collection. They learn the syntax and purpose of loops so they can control how each item in a dataset is checked, filtered, displayed, or searched.

---

